invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: the raw and ca tlsi_config_ok stops asking hspost_ticket_age_ok, so
  ch_connect and ch_record_init offer a ticket older than its lifetime, or
  kept past the seven days RFC 9846 section 4.6.1 allows any ticket. A
  server that checks its own clock still passes such a ticket over, so the
  handshakes in this tree complete either way; the config rows at each
  boundary object.

--- old
    // A ticket past its lifetime, or past the 7 days RFC 9846 allows any
    // ticket (handshake_post.h).
    return hspost_ticket_age_ok(cfg);
--- new
    return 1;
